flowchart TD
    Query[User question]
    Injection[Keyword injection check]
    PIIIn[Presidio input masking]
    Blocked[Return blocked message]
    Week8[Week 8 LM Studio SQL generator]
    Extract[Heuristic SQL extraction]
    SQLGuard[Forbidden-keyword and semicolon checks]
    Rejected[Return unsafe-query message]
    PIIOut[Presidio output masking]
    Response[Return generated text]

    Query --> Injection
    Injection -->|Blocked phrase| Blocked
    Injection -->|Allowed| PIIIn
    PIIIn --> Week8
    Week8 --> Extract
    Extract --> SQLGuard
    SQLGuard -->|Rejected| Rejected
    SQLGuard -->|Allowed| PIIOut
    PIIOut --> Response

    note1[String checks only; no SQL parser, authorization, or database execution]
    note1 -.-> SQLGuard
